 fly home","Mt. Hood → Timberline Lodge → Portland"]],"n",0,[{title:"Day 1: Arrive in Portland",description:"Explore Powell's Books, Washington Park and the food-cart scene. Finish with a great dinner in the Pearl District.",detail:"Sleep: Portland",image:"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/C16NHSHq1iJNU2_HWqD5CQOecMmnV1g7JCHd_wOBNZRXFzui-AF20Ugw8hYWDohnepG9v58oU1i175KzNm_SXWOuagjwOo-tH8veJaL6-vruwpgyIUIkx7kknFRqKIvOtWdf0ShnwtiauyekcNPJA-CA5_a5RBPWFB1asPUq-7w?purpose=inline",alt:"7 Garden Trends That Will Be Huge This Year - Garden Trends 2023"},{title:"Day 2: Columbia River Gorge",description:"Chase waterfalls at Multnomah Falls and Latourell Falls, then visit Hood River for lunch and river views. Return to Portland.",detail:"Sleep: Portland",image:"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/MljZq2TC75tILxl_xmqzEaX5CIIIX-idgxkBiV_D-1G1CVdlZu7W-_yYD90WTDL0LqdE3oGMyDlcun1XzY3A3I6k8Dmy7bcIgjUDEA1nh1X_Ieg8AOFH_VnfWrogOC9kk8ipoR9Bn0BKUBkRN162gRkZ4nZhEjTTQIgZnLETNjmtdwEFvO67bvZHvMKPY0UM?purpose=inline",alt:"Famous Multnomah falls in Columbia river gorge, Oregon"},{title:"Day 3: Cannon Beach",description:"Head to the Pacific. Explore tide pools at Haystack Rock, walk the beach and watch the sunset over the ocean.",detail:"Sleep: Cannon Beach",image:"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/3K8ew7p-c7ZupaaXcMdVq3icQeYAJbO6q77IlxhwHflQpBqAs1cY5NTR_kcT_G3-YUzJRS3jDB66oU3_9pmkI7IqQyae32Vp_R7uf6TfcrZRPl4Y1IxEshV6yNr9yAuCOYD2ea1nWtnb3Lr2zCUKiHtSrLJCnP5R9em0uOpLsBEsa2ADRseZ5gdxlQ6uQ51b?purpose=inline",alt:"Haystack Rock Reflects in Shallow Tide Pool"},{title:"Day 4: Astoria and the coast",description:"Explore Ecola State Park, then drive north to Astoria for maritime history, waterfront views and seafood.",detail:"Sleep: Astoria",image:"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/OMVHrz-RE6MYZh2rbskLRDo3MkmRGRDd1ZeuAjUGPPURtNVLJzgMf7_9bfEUBYUdLR-mZbyBl2UzTVb1IJCXUL0B8rzvQBUtCEuDfbbB-vDtsXxt1boVU4klJdH2JGcLML03_o4xXMHpvrPESg3JUNfFv5sJ-jyjRTcNcfpQu04?purpose=inline",alt:"143 Washington S